# mermaid.js failures are handled like Pele's: the source stays under a note, with the code
# copy button, and mermaid.js draws no error picture
@ source mermaid-invalid.md
@ mermaid mermaid
=2 class="mdr-diagram-error"
=2 <code class="language-mermaid">
=2 class="copy-btn"
+ mermaid.js can't render this diagram:
- class="mdr-diagram"
- Syntax error in text
